ed_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":12,"created_at":"2026-04-28T08:01:11Z","updated_at":"2026-04-28T19:57:26Z","closed_at":"2026-04-28T18:47:14Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nThis bug is present in Godot 4.6.2, and after testing it with 4.6.1 and 4.6 I can conclude it is a bug for the rest of the recent Godot 4 versions.  For a long time I was unable to open the Godot engine in any capacity despite opening it earlier in the month. I had a game jam so I forgot about it for sometime and just switched to Mac, but recently I found out through powershell that the issue was, in fact the gamecube adapter being connected.  After I unconnected the adapter the engine magically started running again.  I have attached a picture with the powershell commands. This will be an issue for anyone trying to make a game with controllers that are connected via this type of adapter, which is quite popular (Mayflash GC Controller Adapter)\n\n<img width=\"2527\" height=\"571\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4c6314f3-99b5-47a7-88d5-e530b936d0c8\" />\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11, Godot 4.6.2\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen the Mayflash Gamecube Adapter is connected, the engine will not run.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nStep 1: Connect Mayflash Gamecube Adapter to USB ports on PC\n\nStep 2: Run godot executable\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nNo project needed, the entire editor refused to open","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119033/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119033/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}